@startuml cu29
!theme plain
title CU29 — Ingresar nuevo concepto

actor "Escribano" as Actor
participant "Notaire system" as System

Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) decides to register a new concept.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Requests: (Name; Amount; Percentage; Whether the amount is fixed or variable)
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) enters the requested data.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Records the entered data and registers a new concept.
System -> System : System

@enduml